<title>POLAND: Polish NBP again buys dlrs at PLN 3.1468 - dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP again buys dlrs at PLN 3.1468 - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) bought dollars on the interbank market at 3.1468 zlotys, dealers said.</p>
<p>The intervention, described as &quot;medium&quot;, came at 1155 GMT when the zloty was at 2.51 percent from the average weighted floating dollar and mark parity rates for today -- the centre of the daily 14-percent trading band.</p>
<p>Earlier the NBP also bought dollars at 3.1460, 3.1465 and marks at 1.8495 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
